{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc8\u00a0<strong>Football Temptations</strong> is an adult <strong>visual novel</strong> with a sports theme, blending the drama of professional football with romance, temptation, and life-changing choices. You play as <strong>James</strong>, a young <strong>American football</strong> player with sky-high potential. This spring, his dream began to take shape: drafted by the Philadelphia Sharkhawks and signed to a rookie contract. Against the odds, he earned a spot on the final roster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065180/extras/02e645b4d39ac54cc75be558745e46ae.poster.avif?t=1774705259\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065180/extras/02e645b4d39ac54cc75be558745e46ae.webm?t=1774705259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065180/extras/02e645b4d39ac54cc75be558745e46ae.mp4?t=1774705259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is just the beginning. To stay on the field\u2014and maybe lead his team all the way to the Bowl\u2014James will have to prove himself fast. A few bad games, and he could be cut. One great season, and he could become a star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off the field, the pressure doesn\u2019t ease up. Fame brings attention, especially from women. But temptation can be dangerous. Your challenge is to <strong>balance personal life and professional ambition</strong>. Every decision counts. How you answer press conferences and interact with teammates, fans, and women will directly impact your performance in each game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victory conditions:</strong> By the end of the season, your goal is to <strong>win the Bowl and have at least one girlfriend by your side</strong>. Achieving only one of these counts as a half-victory, meaning sometimes you\u2019ll need to sacrifice a few games to enrich your personal life. Even a championship can feel empty without someone to share it with.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branched story with meaningful choices</strong> \u2014 your answers and actions lead to different paths and endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full American football season</strong> \u2014 from regular games to playoffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sport-sim elements</strong> \u2014 press conferences, training, social media, and fan reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many female characters</strong> to meet and romance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many conflict situations</strong> with women, fans, teammates and etc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of sex scenes</strong> with different kinks and fetishes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065180/extras/eda4734b07e00aa57b447441c2f477db.poster.avif?t=1774705259\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065180/extras/eda4734b07e00aa57b447441c2f477db.webm?t=1774705259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065180/extras/eda4734b07e00aa57b447441c2f477db.mp4?t=1774705259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2014 you can win the Bowl or fail to reach the playoffs, you can end up with a different girlfriend depending on your choices</p>